You'll definitely want magic resistance from this wish, in my opinion.
If you haven't done Sokoban yet, you've a good chance of getting
reflection there. If you -have-, you're likely getting toward gypsy
territory and will want MR while trying to cadge a source of
reflection from one.

I'd go for the cloak, myself. You'll almost certainly end up wearing
dragon mail, either DDSM or SDSM, in the long run. The dragon mail's
casting penalty is pretty small, and advancing spellcasting skills to
basic offsets it completely if you ditch the shield. Priests can
advance all spellcasting skills, so this is a good bet.

For any race -but- doppelganger, I'd advise taking the GDSM for the
short-term AC bonus and sorting it out later. But doppelgangers get
pretty good natural AC; with your starting shield and robe (still have
that?), you'll do well wishing for a blessed fireproof +2 cloak of
magic resistance.
 
